  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NileOASIS v2.0.3\n\nNile Serverless Postgres Multi-Tenant SaaS Provider Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 9 new providers — 202 total (+restaking, +sequencing, +edge storage, +identity) (b9c9d9d)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- feat(NileOASIS): run Nile on the PostgreSQL provider's full Npgsql implementation (4c319cc)\n- Restore clean provider builds and integration startup (be39ecd)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NileOASIS",
